// Techniques: knowledge held by populations (each cell's people know a set).
//
// A technique can be invented where its requirements are met: the
// techniques it builds on (`requires`, listed earlier in this file), crops or
// herds the people keep (`requires_crops`, `requires_herds`), one of some
// domesticated species (`requires_species`), and the place (`where`):
//   river   a river runs through the cell        coast   it touches the sea
//   water   river or coast                       dry     under 900 mm of rain
//   hills   above 600 m                          forest  a forest biome
// Each year the chance of inventing it is `rate` x sqrt(people / 10,000) x
// (0.5 + innovation) x the culture's affinity: 1 + sum of weight x 2 x
// (trait - 0.5) over `affinity` (at least 0.1). Neighbours who know it teach
// it (borrowing); populations under 500 people forget a little each year
// (the Tasmanian effect: Henrich 2004), and techniques whose requirements are
// gone fade.
//
// `start_chance`: share of the starting peoples who already know it.
//
// Effects (add up over techniques, where each applies):
//   crop_yield      farmland crops x (1 + sum)
//   herd_yield      herds x (1 + sum)
//   forage          land foraging (plants and game) x (1 + sum)
//   aquatic         fish and shellfish x (1 + sum)
//   harvest_buffer  share of a bad harvest's shortfall made good (stores)
//   famine          famine mortality x (1 + sum), so negative is better
//   contact         learning from and teaching neighbours x (1 + sum)
//   administration  how far a capital's rule reaches x (1 + sum): writing,
//                   bureaucracy and roads let states hold distant land
//
// `min_town`: inventing the technique needs a town of at least this many
// people in the cell (writing grew out of temple and palace accounting in
// cities); keeping it does not.
{
  "version": 1,
  "techniques": [
    {"id": "bow", "name": "Bow and arrow", "rate": 0.00002, "start_chance": 0.5,
     "affinity": {"plant_reliance": -0.5},
     "effects": {"forage": 0.08}},
    {"id": "nets", "name": "Fishing nets and weirs", "where": "water", "rate": 0.00003, "start_chance": 0.4,
     "affinity": {"mobility": -0.5},
